{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T13:01:26.589Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T13:01:26.589Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"in_progress"}],"before_hash":"c294f9f7393625a8998037af7d763b55515eae19bfe3e829e495f7ba3757a2af","after_hash":"069f4004c54c40262f1f01f5ef547ef670df775a15abf2f10077535e288a94e2","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"dfeb0ed85ac52ce0c147ebf7f92efddec205bcf0cc82a81cf9a4244989493266"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T13:05:41.376Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-27T13:05:41.375Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Review follow-up (ancestry bound finding): the class rule is 'a function that receives an explicit bound must not scan past it'. Package audit: sectionPath(text, offset) was the one instance - it parsed every heading line of the whole cited document before breaking at the offset, so anchor() and passageContext() paid a full-document scan even for passages cited at the top of a 16MB source. Fixed by giving headingLines an exclusive end bound (retired-engine-exact for every offset kind, including the NaN and +/-Infinity quirks the unbounded break had - found by the property test) and letting sectionPath scan only lines before the offset. NOT instances of the rule, verified: paragraph() must scan the whole document because heading uniqueness is its contract; hits() must report every occurrence; anchor/passageContext context slices are already length-bounded; adapter maxBytes/timeoutMs are enforced at entry with pinned tests. Revert proof for the bound: with only the bound reverted, the new budget test fails deterministically (bounded region measured 2682.2ms against its 25ms budget, 107x over, no JIT-boundary flakiness) and the property test still passes; restored, 2/2 pass. The property test compares sectionPath against an inline unbounded reference across 300 random documents x 11 offset kinds, so any semantic drift from adding bounds anywhere in the ancestry path fails the suite."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T13:05:41.376Z"}],"before_hash":"069f4004c54c40262f1f01f5ef547ef670df775a15abf2f10077535e288a94e2","after_hash":"6156c284fd3d263e088e4bfc14fb416312adfd6396442d2d84b158ce2206d7eb","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3741cfb25d7c426deba4eb0cac0818585df8b85d61a644f673ecec50831abf28"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T13:39:43.045Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-27T13:39:43.042Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Full-gate round: duplication back to 0% (the two property tests now share one randomized document builder; the ancestry oracle was restated independently as a filter/every formulation so no clone pair remains); docstring, lint, typecheck and identity clean; dist rebuilt and dist:check verifies 56 committed artifacts with 168 refused mutations. Local full suite: 148 of 156 tests completed pass, 0 fail, the remaining long-running race tests exceeded the 30-minute local window on this loaded host and are certified by CI as in the previous rounds. Focused suites: 36/36 including the four new bound tests."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T13:39:43.045Z"}],"before_hash":"6156c284fd3d263e088e4bfc14fb416312adfd6396442d2d84b158ce2206d7eb","after_hash":"820ca250f6819422c02cfa88aafd3e448cb04992db908225ee27a1370b4b132d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7e89225660260816f0cb3db0de2b25fa01c5f32adb7009fdae58a3f24b0b98fb"}
